WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.067
Here Putin is today.

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:01.401
So he

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.003
met with the chairman of what's

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:05.105
called the Russian Constitutional Court.

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:07.474
And this man pulls out a map

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:09.342
from the 17th century

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:10.210
to show Putin

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.611
and to make a very specific point

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:12.278
about Ukraine.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.280
Just listen to it for yourself.

00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:17.951
Nicholas, who appeared in court.

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:20.253
We found a copy of a map

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:22.322
from the 17th century

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:23.923
created during the time of Louis,

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:26.860
the 14th in the middle of the 17th.

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:29.996
In the second half of the 17th century,

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:32.999
created by the French themselves.

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:34.834
Why did I bring it

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.037
Vladimir Vladimirovich.

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:38.805
It has no Ukraine.

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:39.305
Because it was,

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:40.807
of course, Soviet rule

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:42.442
created Soviet Ukraine.

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:43.843
It is a well-known fact.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:44.611
No, Ukraine

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:45.812
existed in the history

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:49.482
of humankind until then.

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:51.184
Well, you go back to the time of Louis

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:52.085
14th, of course.

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:53.653
Gosh, you can go further and see

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:55.455
he was the founder of Moscow.

00:00:55.455 --> 00:00:56.256
You get the point.

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:58.958
That's the absurdity that Putin was was

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:00.593
wanted today.

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:01.261
Fred Pleitgen

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:02.462
and Matthew Chance are both standing

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:03.930
by with new reporting on OUTFRONT.

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:04.931
I want to begin first, though,

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:06.232
with you in Kiev, Fred,

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:06.866
because you're hearing

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.101
about a new explosion in

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:09.035
Belgrade tonight.

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:12.806
You're absolutely right, Erin.

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:13.606
And while Vladimir

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:14.374
Putin seems to indicate

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:15.708
there used to be no Ukraine, certainly

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:15.975
right now

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:17.477
the Russians seem to be feeling the heat,

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:18.511
at least it appears

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:20.713
from Ukraine, in fact, right now.

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:21.514
Just a couple of minutes ago,

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:23.049
the governor of that Belgorod

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:24.250
region, who you were talking about,

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.185
who was criticizing

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:26.252
the Russian military,

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.220
he said that there had been

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.955
another possible strike

00:01:28.955 --> 00:01:31.124
by a drone in the Belgorod region

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:32.258
and that some sort of munition

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:33.693
was dropped on a roadway

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.328
and damaged a car there.

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:35.695
Of course,

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:36.262
that's something

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:37.530
that we've seen several times

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:38.698
over the past couple of days.

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:40.900
Also, in light of those incursions

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:41.701
that have been happening

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:42.936
and despite the fact that,

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.370
as Matthew has been reporting

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.605
and we've been reporting,

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:46.940
those are Russians

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:49.142
who are going into Ukrainian territory.

00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:50.877
So it's Russians against Russians.

00:01:50.877 --> 00:01:51.811
The Russian government

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:53.279
in the form of Dmitry Peskov,

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:54.481
the spokesman for Vladimir

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:55.882
Putin, is trying to pin this

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:57.117
on the Ukrainians.

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.318
He says today

00:01:58.318 --> 00:01:59.285
that he believes

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:00.386
this all shows

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:03.189
that Russia is under attack from Ukraine

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:04.591
and that therefore

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:06.159
Russia's war against

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:08.294
Ukraine is justified now.

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:09.362
I also asked

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:10.096
the national security

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:11.264
adviser of Ukraine

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:13.233
whether or not the Ukrainians are afraid

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:15.135
that there could be massive retaliation

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:16.503
from the Russians after this,

00:02:16.503 --> 00:02:18.605
perhaps another massive missile strike.

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:19.372
And he said, look,

00:02:19.372 --> 00:02:20.507
the Russians are already striking us

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:21.407
almost every day.

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:21.908
They've hit us

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:24.644
with more than 1400 missiles already.

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:26.246
What else is going to come?

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:28.014
And at the same time, of course, Erin,

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:30.216
the Ukrainians are also preparing

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:32.685
for that big counter offensive.

00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:34.120
And I asked him where that stands.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:34.921
Here's what he had to say,

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:37.590
which, of course,

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:37.924
we are

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:40.226
clearly aware of when, where,

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:42.462
how and what should start.

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:44.797
The final decision is up to the president

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:46.466
and the security staff

00:02:46.466 --> 00:02:47.967
when the decision is made.

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:50.236
Russia will definitely feel it,

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.371
which will

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:54.374
And of course, one of the things

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:55.775
that we also have to talk about, Erin,

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:56.976
and this is very important

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:58.011
in that context,

00:02:58.011 --> 00:02:59.913
is the situation in Bermuda

00:02:59.913 --> 00:03:01.080
where the Russians, of course, had

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.549
said they took the entire city

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:03.449
National security adviser

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:04.417
also telling me

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:05.418
that that is not true,

00:03:05.418 --> 00:03:05.985
that the Ukraine

00:03:05.985 --> 00:03:07.320
still have troops in the city.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.788
He also said that the fact

00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:09.689
that the Ukrainians

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:11.724
are still holding out in Bermuda

00:03:11.724 --> 00:03:13.159
and trying to strike back

00:03:13.159 --> 00:03:15.428
is also a key factor in the Ukrainians

00:03:15.428 --> 00:03:16.563
being able to prepare

00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:18.064
for that counteroffensive.

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:18.198
That,

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:20.033
of course, could happen at any time Erin.

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:20.400
All right.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.168
Thank you very much, Fred, in Kiev.

